```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Submit BOTH Content-Length and chunked Transfer-Encoding")
val d = body_decision([("Content-Length", "10"), ("Transfer-Encoding", "chunked")], 1024, true)
expect(d.0.starts_with("400")).to_be(true)
```

</details>

